#: ../../source/docs/safety-multicopter.rst:5 30938c2eff0a49f29ba6f39a04344598
msgid "MultiCopter Safety"
msgstr "多旋翼安全"

#: ../../source/docs/safety-multicopter.rst:9 5e0da11487b646459244aeb75a7db6b3
msgid "Your first priority must be the safety of people!"
msgstr "人身安全必须放在首位！"

#: ../../source/docs/safety-multicopter.rst:11
#: 1ecae27157ce47698f188e70af7ed8dc
msgid ""
"**Crashes can happen, because of pilot error or hardware or software "
"malfunction.**"
msgstr "**坠机可能因飞手失误或硬件/软件故障而发生。**"

#: ../../source/docs/safety-multicopter.rst:13
#: 16c9157754b042a2b12169424de8f3a2
msgid ""
"**If you are flying anywhere near other people, you are putting them at "
"risk!**"
msgstr "**如果您在他人附近飞行，您正在将他们置于危险之中！**"

#: ../../source/docs/safety-multicopter.rst:16
#: db7d048aaca341439416f955778bff17
msgid ""
"Be sure to maintain safe distances between yourself, and spectators and your"
" copter."
msgstr "请确保在您自己、观众和飞行器之间保持安全距离。"

#: ../../source/docs/safety-multicopter.rst:18
#: 38b71637be014e6a8932c24fee426f54
msgid ""
"Circumstances will require that you will need to make your own determination"
" of what is a \"safe distance\" from people and property."
msgstr "实际情况需要您自行判断与人员和财产的\"安全距离\"。"

#: ../../source/docs/safety-multicopter.rst:21
#: a577aaa2036e4cb081d2fc6baf9aaa9b
msgid ""
"At a minimum, consider: at least 10ft (3m) but not further than 30ft (10m) "
"from you."
msgstr "最低要求：距您至少10英尺（3米），但不超过30英尺（10米）。"

#: ../../source/docs/safety-multicopter.rst:23
#: bb355e3908fb4388ad619216e5c3f438
msgid ""
"Keep all other people, property and obstacles considerably further away from"
" your copter."
msgstr "使其他人员、财产和障碍物与您的飞行器保持更远的距离。"

#: ../../source/docs/safety-multicopter.rst:25
#: 3064ca041681410397a04c2cc036d3b9
msgid "Ensure that no one gets between you and your copter."
msgstr "确保没有人站在您与飞行器之间。"

#: ../../source/docs/safety-multicopter.rst:26
#: 9cd0549c4675464c8578bafd50f17dcc
msgid "Spectators should always be a safe distance behind the pilot."
msgstr "观众应始终在飞手身后的安全距离处。"

#: ../../source/docs/safety-multicopter.rst:27
#: e5bc016e78ff4e25a156ec332cc0f035
msgid ""
"If people intrude beyond what you have determined to be the \"safe\" area, "
"land immediately and do not take off until they are clear."
msgstr "如果有人越过您认定的\"安全\"区域，立即降落，等其离开后再起飞。"

#: ../../source/docs/safety-multicopter.rst:29
#: e1236a67532b45d5906998ba5bfb8dd0
msgid ""
"At full power, an average sized multi-copter can exceed 20 mph (32 km/h), "
"can ascend to hundreds of feet and easily travel more than a mile in "
"distance before running out of battery."
msgstr "在全功率下，一架普通尺寸的多旋翼可超过20英里/小时（32公里/小时），能爬升数百英尺，并轻松飞行超过一英里才耗尽电池。"

#: ../../source/docs/safety-multicopter.rst:33
#: 1784f06355eb4eb7acb88de1ba575d01
msgid ""
"**If you are flying too high or near airports you are putting manned "
"aircraft and the people on them at risk!**"
msgstr "**如果您飞行高度过高或靠近机场，您正在将有人驾驶飞机及其乘客置于危险之中！**"

#: ../../source/docs/safety-multicopter.rst:36
#: 9c8305eb3300406aa4f87c5326c4ef12
msgid ""
"Get to know where your nearest airports are and do not fly anywhere near "
"them"
msgstr "了解最近的机场位置，不要在其附近飞行"

#: ../../source/docs/safety-multicopter.rst:39
#: f9ac6a9aa3274dbd9ff247f2b2ef58bf
msgid ""
"**Always ensure the battery cable is NOT connected to the power distribution"
" board or harness until you are ready to fly.**"
msgstr "**在准备好飞行之前，务必确保电池电缆未连接到电源分配板或线束。**"

#: ../../source/docs/safety-multicopter.rst:42
#: 6785affb064540b5a349a15ee50e89c9
msgid ""
"Always Turn on the transmitter and ensure the throttle stick is all the way "
"down **BEFORE** connecting the battery."
msgstr "在连接电池**之前**，始终先打开遥控器并确保油门摇杆完全拉低。"

#: ../../source/docs/safety-multicopter.rst:44
#: 0a7bcd2222c045da80f33769da3263ba
msgid ""
"After landing the first thing you should do is disconnect your battery "
"cable."
msgstr "降落后，第一件事应该是断开电池电缆。"

#: ../../source/docs/safety-multicopter.rst:46
#: fb7fd7e5f60b43fb9fd94f00acf2f2be
msgid ""
"Do not turn off the transmitter until after you have disconnected the "
"battery."
msgstr "断开电池之前，不要关闭遥控器。"

#: ../../source/docs/safety-multicopter.rst:48
#: 6a40a679046a4dfbb02a5df7493c5767
msgid ""
"Always remove your props while you are testing motors, your hands, arms and "
"face and those of your friends will thank you."
msgstr "测试电机时，务必拆下螺旋桨，您的手、胳膊、脸以及朋友们会对此表示感谢。"

#: ../../source/docs/safety-multicopter.rst:50
#: e6aff556b1ce49209ceeaa816b0f9379
msgid ""
"When the battery is connected, always assume the motors are armed; you can "
"check with a short throttle pulse."
msgstr "连接电池后，始终假定电机已解锁；可通过短暂给予油门脉冲进行确认。"

#: ../../source/docs/safety-multicopter.rst:52
#: d0801336a89d4d548f5fbb4ce5952fce
msgid ""
"Don't pick up the model and the radio at the same time, you may bump the "
"throttle."
msgstr "不要同时拿起飞行器和遥控器，可能会不小心碰动油门。"

#: ../../source/docs/safety-multicopter.rst:54
#: 1f2becadccdd4eddbedc124e6c7a1c64
msgid ""
"Do not attempt to fly longer than your battery's safe capacity, it is very "
"bad for the battery and can cause a crash."
msgstr "不要飞行超过电池安全容量的时间，这对电池非常有害，并可能导致坠机。"

#: ../../source/docs/safety-multicopter.rst:57
#: 732c0b59d3e14b5c85404f42ef651fe8
msgid "**ArduPilot includes a motor arming safety feature.**"
msgstr "**ArduPilot包含电机解锁安全功能。**"

#: ../../source/docs/safety-multicopter.rst:59
#: c615487487b44a78b84a8ec8a8ffdef2
msgid ""
"Immediately prior to flight after the battery has been connected, the RC "
"transmitter's throttle stick needs to be held down and to the right for "
"several seconds to arm the motors."
msgstr "连接电池后准备飞行前，需要将RC遥控器的油门摇杆向下并向右保持数秒以解锁电机。"

#: ../../source/docs/safety-multicopter.rst:62
#: 298e2ab5ee8942ab87b4ca4abc80767b
msgid ""
"After landing your first response should be to hold the throttle down and to"
" the left for several seconds to \"Disarm\" the motors. Disarm condition can"
" be tested by moving the throttle stick up, if the motors do not move it is "
"probably disarmed."
msgstr "降落后，第一反应应该是将油门摇杆向下并向左保持数秒以\"上锁\"电机。上锁状态可通过向上推油门摇杆来验证，若电机不转则说明已上锁。"

#: ../../source/docs/safety-multicopter.rst:66
#: b5227f11f6ff4322a402d920da33d42a
msgid ""
"Even when disarmed, the throttle stick should always be kept in the full "
"down position except when flying."
msgstr "即使在上锁状态下，油门摇杆也应始终保持在最低位置，飞行时除外。"

#: ../../source/docs/safety-multicopter.rst:69
#: 99b13df08f704be1a209ff6626efc9a4
msgid ""
"**Get used to switching back to Stabilize mode from other modes and "
"reassuming full manual control.**"
msgstr "**养成从其他模式切换回Stabilize模式并重新取得完全手动控制的习惯。**"

#: ../../source/docs/safety-multicopter.rst:72
#: d50e6ca2bfcb43408fea28bfe6ba422a
msgid "This is the single most important recovery technique (practice it)."
msgstr "这是最重要的单一恢复技术（请多加练习）。"

#: ../../source/docs/safety-multicopter.rst:74
#: 155d36b8916248d289f8acd2b1eabab3
msgid ""
"Stabilize mode can have Simple mode added to it, but if you do you should "
"then practice with it till you are proficient."
msgstr "Stabilize模式可与Simple模式结合使用，但如果这样做，应练习直至熟练。"

#: ../../source/docs/safety-multicopter.rst:76
#: 263bf632e8bb42d7a2eb7a270e0a891f
msgid ""
"Do not start using any other modes than Stabilize or Stabilize plus Simple "
"until you are VERY comfortable flying your copter."
msgstr "在您对飞行器飞行非常熟练之前，不要使用除Stabilize或Stabilize加Simple以外的任何其他模式。"

#: ../../source/docs/safety-multicopter.rst:79
#: b389f4d60b9c435aa44636e63d8ebdbd
msgid "**It is very important to have excess power available.**"
msgstr "**保持足够的余量动力非常重要。**"

#: ../../source/docs/safety-multicopter.rst:81
#: 9b807a70e2774a0caced8b367bc65937
msgid ""
"If you have insufficient power, the automatic controls can require more "
"throttle than is available and destabilization may result."
msgstr "如果动力不足，自动控制可能需要超出可用量的油门，从而导致失稳。"

#: ../../source/docs/safety-multicopter.rst:83
#: 0849f531d6b248c3b7debd67775cfd9e
msgid ""
"Ideally your copter should be able to hover at about 50% throttle (mid "
"stick)."
msgstr "理想情况下，您的飞行器应能在约50%油门（摇杆居中）时悬停。"

#: ../../source/docs/safety-multicopter.rst:86
#: 64144b3dc67f401482f6aeefd2540efa
msgid ""
"**Especially while you are learning, it is recommended that you avoid "
"expensive, stiff, ultra-sharp carbon fiber props.**"
msgstr "**尤其是在学习阶段，建议避免使用昂贵、坚硬、超锋利的碳纤维桨。**"

#: ../../source/docs/safety-multicopter.rst:89
#: 3671a0437d9d4cc3ae0eab6852e7edfb
msgid "Get cheaper, more flexible and more breakable plastic propellers."
msgstr "使用价格较低、更柔韧且更易折断的塑料螺旋桨。"

#: ../../source/docs/safety-multicopter.rst:90
#: c1c3238896a647559710af13d15bfd8a
msgid ""
"Some of the super carbon fiber ones can cut better than a Ginsu and while "
"they are almost indestructible - you are not."
msgstr "某些超级碳纤维桨的切割力堪比Ginsu刀，虽然它们几乎坚不可摧——但您并不是。"

#: ../../source/docs/safety-multicopter.rst:93
#: 6fa68541a06a4ac7b7f57416e81e41b3
msgid ""
"**Important primary response to a crash, inadequate landing or unknown "
"autopilot state.**"
msgstr "**发生坠机、降落不当或飞控状态不明时的重要首要处置措施。**"

#: ../../source/docs/safety-multicopter.rst:96
#: 39ecce6cbde94402bc7aebf99fabea63
msgid ""
"The first thing to do is throw a towel over your copters propellers "
"(Propellers may start spinning unexpectedly)."
msgstr "第一件事是将毛巾盖在飞行器螺旋桨上（螺旋桨可能意外开始旋转）。"

#: ../../source/docs/safety-multicopter.rst:98
#: 3e857c961e624254ac5b5baf6853794e
msgid "Then immediately disconnect the battery."
msgstr "然后立即断开电池。"

#: ../../source/docs/safety-multicopter.rst:99
#: 2c2b959cace748a39966e64fb1a2b3db
msgid ""
"A large towel is your most important piece of safety equipment followed by a"
" fire extinguisher and a first aid kit."
msgstr "一条大毛巾是您最重要的安全设备，其次是灭火器和急救箱。"

#: ../../source/docs/safety-multicopter.rst:101
#: 17b429aa210f4816811e37d36858d819
msgid "Generally better to use the first one than the last one."
msgstr "通常最好先用第一件，而不是最后一件。"

#: ../../source/docs/safety-multicopter.rst:103
#: 1c03d9c9274f4ee0bb88051465b1d1f1
msgid ""
"**When testing or flying any of the (waypoint) navigation modes (using "
"GPS):**"
msgstr "**测试或飞行任何（航点）导航模式（使用GPS）时：**"

#: ../../source/docs/safety-multicopter.rst:106
#: e03e70ef832c45618f2f92bbf4a4e98f
msgid "Ensure that your GPS has \"Lock\" before arming and takeoff."
msgstr "确保在解锁和起飞前GPS已\"锁定\"。"

#: ../../source/docs/safety-multicopter.rst:107
#: d40b36de3bfd4b84921d4af55131a939
msgid ""
"Check that your home position on the Mission Planner is in fact correct."
msgstr "检查 Mission Planner 上的Home位置是否实际正确。"

#: ../../source/docs/safety-multicopter.rst:109
#: 5c235192fb564a048e4cbc71e51b2cf7
msgid ""
"If the GPS does not accurately report your home position, reboot and wait "
"for 8 or more satellites (not just 3D lock) and check again."
msgstr "如果GPS未准确报告您的Home位置，请重启并等待8颗或更多卫星（不只是3D锁定），然后再次检查。"

#: ../../source/docs/safety-multicopter.rst:113
#: 2b7f9086b9ae4ae9b236bb5e2c97cd42
msgid "**Always follow the law:**"
msgstr "**始终遵守法律：**"

#: ../../source/docs/safety-multicopter.rst:115
#: 73a21e95a1e947b2af5159fc8b11d4b9
msgid ""
"Our personal use of MultiCopters (models in general) is continually under "
"attack by those who fear 'drones' and invasion of privacy.  If you break the"
" law, or invade someone's privacy, or put them in harm's way, you threaten "
"the future of our personal use of models. Please, understand the law and the"
" rights of others - and fly accordingly."
msgstr ""
"我们个人使用多旋翼飞行器（一般模型飞机）的权利正持续受到那些担忧\"无人机\"和隐私侵犯者的攻击。如果您违法、侵犯他人隐私或将他人置于危险之中，您将威胁到我们个人使用模型飞机的未来。请理解法律和他人权利，并据此飞行。"

#: ../../source/docs/safety-multicopter.rst:121
#: c834e1b3c80e488984d040da123fcd10
msgid ""
"Most countries have a prominent model aircraft organization. In the USA that"
" is the `AMA <https://www.modelaircraft.org/>`__. Review the AMA `safety "
"code <https://www.modelaircraft.org/sites/default/files/105.pdf>`__. Working"
" with the FAA and other government organizations, the AMA has established "
"(and continues to update) rules for `First Person View (FPV) Operations "
"<https://www.modelaircraft.org/system/files/documents/550.pdf>`__. If you "
"are in the USA (or not), read these documents! The AMA has a strong lobbying"
" group that will help protect our rights. Get involved and support your "
"country's model aircraft organizations - and help protect our right to fly."
msgstr ""
"大多数国家都有重要的模型飞机组织。在美国是 `AMA <https://www.modelaircraft.org/>`__。请查阅AMA `安全规范 "
"<https://www.modelaircraft.org/sites/default/files/105.pdf>`__。AMA与FAA及其他政府机构合作，制定（并持续更新）了"
" `第一人称视角（FPV）操作 "
"<https://www.modelaircraft.org/system/files/documents/550.pdf>`__ "
"的规则。无论您是否在美国，请阅读这些文件！AMA拥有强大的游说团体，将帮助保护我们的权利。请积极参与并支持您所在国家的模型飞机组织，帮助保护我们的飞行权利。"

#: ../../source/docs/safety-multicopter.rst:133
#: d777eec627f840f291512339f42ff718
msgid "Most important: Keep a safe distance between your Copter and People!"
msgstr "最重要：保持飞行器与人员之间的安全距离！"

#: ../../source/docs/safety-multicopter.rst:138
#: 665c032f8dc443bd80132d89045c41cc
msgid "These tips can also help protect your multicopter from damage."
msgstr "这些技巧也有助于保护您的多旋翼飞行器免受损坏。"

#: ../../source/docs/safety-multicopter.rst:141
#: 5a4b0a7a04ea485d8154396af3c8ce57
msgid "**Avoid sudden or extreme transmitter control stick deflections.**"
msgstr "**避免突然或大幅度的遥控器摇杆偏转。**"

#: ../../source/docs/safety-multicopter.rst:143
#: c393307a9db640d4994df0e85802133a
msgid ""
"Move the control sticks in small measured increments and don't \"yank\" on "
"them."
msgstr "以小幅、有节制的增量移动摇杆，不要\"猛拉\"。"

#: ../../source/docs/safety-multicopter.rst:145
#: 94319d71550d41a49cc7517eddd94b19
msgid ""
"If the copter is properly calibrated and balanced it should require only "
"small stick inputs to control altitude, direction and speed."
msgstr "如果飞行器已正确校准和配平，只需小幅摇杆输入即可控制高度、方向和速度。"

#: ../../source/docs/safety-multicopter.rst:149
#: 08f5567b21214fe6b82f423af209a142
msgid ""
"**Your copter should be more or less stable on the horizontal plane without "
"any control inputs.**"
msgstr "**您的飞行器在没有任何控制输入的情况下，应在水平面上基本保持稳定。**"

#: ../../source/docs/safety-multicopter.rst:152
#: 304703f7b4fa43cc93dc7b15bcb6706b
msgid ""
"If you are \"fighting\" the copter, land and fix it - something is not right"
" - Hardware adjustment or software calibration may be required."
msgstr "如果您在与飞行器\"搏斗\"，请降落并查找问题——有些地方不对——可能需要硬件调整或软件校准。"

#: ../../source/docs/safety-multicopter.rst:156
#: 8b9c6f4b5433444790e921efc0d4af27
msgid ""
"**Be especially careful of large throttle inputs, as a copter can gain (or "
"lose) altitude very rapidly.**"
msgstr "**尤其要注意大幅度油门输入，因为飞行器可以非常迅速地爬升（或下降）高度。**"

#: ../../source/docs/safety-multicopter.rst:158
#: 1aba431b0479438db965a7bad1327db2
msgid ""
"**Because MultiCopters are symmetrical it is especially easy to lose Visual "
"Orientation.**"
msgstr "**由于多旋翼外形对称，极易失去视觉方向感。**"

#: ../../source/docs/safety-multicopter.rst:161
#: af6a3e07fa044173a83509416627f72c
msgid ""
"For manual flight modes, maintaining a clear vision of the Copters "
"Orientation (direction it is facing) is the most critical part of successful"
" flight."
msgstr "对于手动飞行模式，清楚地判断飞行器方向（即机头朝向）是成功飞行最关键的部分。"

#: ../../source/docs/safety-multicopter.rst:164
#: c164444371aa45e4a35d1a860a739709
msgid ""
"Especially while learning it is very important to keep your copter "
"appropriately close to you to aid in maintaining visual orientation."
msgstr "尤其是在学习阶段，保持飞行器与您的距离适当近，有助于维持视觉方向感，这一点非常重要。"

#: ../../source/docs/safety-multicopter.rst:167
#: e7b72cfe139744b387ffc1a9aa013e02
msgid ""
"Generally: more than 10ft (3m) but not further than 30ft (10m) from you."
msgstr "通常：距您10英尺（3米）以上，但不超过30英尺（10米）。"

#: ../../source/docs/safety-multicopter.rst:169
#: 90703dfb998f40febf4e3a75ca103c00
msgid ""
"If the copter gets further than about 100ft (30m) it starts getting "
"difficult to be able to maintain **orientation** and can easily crash."
msgstr "如果飞行器飞到距您约100英尺（30米）以外，将开始难以维持**方向感**，容易坠机。"

#: ../../source/docs/safety-multicopter.rst:172
#: b560bb9aebdb40ec8b29dc550c89d34b
msgid ""
"If you lose Yaw orientation while flying in Stabilize mode, try only flying "
"forward and using yaw to steer like a car."
msgstr "如果在Stabilize模式下飞行时失去偏航方向感，请尝试只向前飞行，像开车一样用偏航来转向。"

#: ../../source/docs/safety-multicopter.rst:174
#: f617eb841dce4abfba2ff9f25ffcb4ce
msgid ""
"It is much better to simply descend and land rather than have an "
"**orientation-induced** crash or worse still - a **fly away**."
msgstr "选择降落而非坚持飞行，要比发生**因方向感丧失而导致的坠机**或更糟糕的**飞走**好得多。"

#: ../../source/docs/safety-multicopter.rst:176
#: 2439c8acc29b4cfd8eb23be98df85a8f
msgid ""
"Fly-Aways often happen when the copter is commanded to tilt back towards the"
" pilot but has rotated in the meantime and is so far away that orientation "
"is lost."
msgstr "飞走通常发生在飞行器被指令向飞手方向倾斜，但此时飞行器已旋转，且距离太远以至于失去方向感。"

#: ../../source/docs/safety-multicopter.rst:179
#: f5b6dd67300f4b85811f3cf5454ac875
msgid "Result: the copter flies further away and crashes or is lost."
msgstr "结果：飞行器飞得更远并坠机或丢失。"

#: ../../source/docs/safety-multicopter.rst:181
#: d68baf9f656c42eab93ee0ebc46ac720
msgid ""
"**Always have Stabilize mode as the (Go To) one of your mode switch "
"options.**"
msgstr "**始终将Stabilize模式设置为（紧急）飞行模式开关选项之一。**"

#: ../../source/docs/safety-multicopter.rst:183
#: 0d930ce745944c48a65c65575ae14156
msgid ""
"**High or unexpected winds or gusts can make flight considerably more "
"difficult.**"
msgstr "**大风或突然的阵风会使飞行变得相当困难。**"

#: ../../source/docs/safety-multicopter.rst:186
#: 429d2358c6ca467c839730a210f7e4a6
msgid ""
"High winds can prevent forward progress or spin the copter around causing "
"you to become disoriented."
msgstr "大风可能阻止飞行器前进，或使飞行器旋转导致您失去方向感。"

#: ../../source/docs/safety-multicopter.rst:188
#: 3b5ef783dd714dbaabf1edb40a4217ca
msgid "The higher you are, the more likely high winds will be a problem."
msgstr "飞行高度越高，大风越可能成为问题。"

#: ../../source/docs/safety-multicopter.rst:189
#: 3e378ff2b40f40aa91dc4929e3eb4a46
msgid ""
"Switching to Stabilize mode and landing before you reach your skill limits "
"can help you save your copter."
msgstr "在达到您技术极限之前切换到Stabilize模式降落，有助于保护您的飞行器。"

#: ../../source/docs/safety-multicopter.rst:191
#: 20cf079325ad4ff0b2bc61c48952be28
msgid ""
"Avoid flying at high speed or high altitude until you have gained "
"considerable confidence in both manual and automatic modes."
msgstr "在手动和自动模式下均积累了相当的信心之前，避免高速或高空飞行。"

#: ../../source/docs/safety-multicopter.rst:193
#: 1f319be6ee25432ca2b6c835d451da29
msgid ""
"When flying around trees or buildings it is very easy to lose visual "
"orientation or even to lose sight of the copter completely."
msgstr "在树木或建筑物附近飞行时，极易失去视觉方向感，甚至完全看不到飞行器。"

#: ../../source/docs/safety-multicopter.rst:195
#: 0e4c9968655940d8b0b4fdb4a368c5c9
msgid "Gusting winds around objects can also worsen the problem."
msgstr "物体周围的阵风也会加剧问题。"

#: ../../source/docs/safety-multicopter.rst:196
#: ced7ec10eda041b1912cd3431a65dc37
msgid "Radio signal loss can also occur."
msgstr "也可能发生无线电信号丢失。"

#: ../../source/docs/safety-multicopter.rst:197
#: 667345ac0bb743a68e0970aad519ce45
msgid ""
"If your copter is approaching a potentially interfering object, immediately "
"switch to Stabilize mode and land or retrieve the copter to your location."
msgstr "如果飞行器正在靠近可能造成干扰的物体，请立即切换到Stabilize模式，降落或将飞行器收回至您身边。"

#: ../../source/docs/safety-multicopter.rst:201
#: d170baa591ce4d59b54aa2c4494b6d96
msgid "**ArduPilot specific safety modes: RTL, FailSafe and GeoFence.**"
msgstr "**ArduPilot特有的安全模式：RTL、失控保护和地理围栏。**"

#: ../../source/docs/safety-multicopter.rst:203
#: 515a80aa4ba24de1a9bf844c9678f133
msgid ""
"RTL can provide a safe **Return to Launch** if it starts to get away from "
"you."
msgstr "RTL可以在飞行器即将失控时提供安全的**返回起飞点**功能。"

#: ../../source/docs/safety-multicopter.rst:205
#: 1eb15a0a691a4ebd8802d47c647be962
msgid ""
"Set up a **FailSafe** on Radio Fail with an RTL or Descend response to save "
"your Copter and prevent Injury."
msgstr "设置无线电失联的**失控保护**，配合RTL或下降响应，可保护您的飞行器并防止伤害。"

#: ../../source/docs/safety-multicopter.rst:207
#: 73814268377b460c90cedd13d63660cd
msgid ""
"**GeoFence** establishes an automatic flying perimeter that will force your "
"copter to stay in a safe proximity."
msgstr "**地理围栏**建立自动飞行边界，强制飞行器保持在安全范围内。"

#: ../../source/docs/safety-multicopter.rst:209
#: 1cf232c984b048f3b08bd9eef7c0237e
msgid ""
"Do not rely solely on the above safety modes, always be ready to take back "
"control in Stabilize and set the copter down."
msgstr "不要仅依赖上述安全模式，始终做好在Stabilize模式下重新取得控制并降落飞行器的准备。"

#: ../../source/docs/safety-multicopter.rst:211
#: 767e2e7e7f934783932f401781bf3281
msgid ""
"Especially do not rely on the above safety modes to perform maneuvers or "
"training that you would otherwise consider dangerous."
msgstr "尤其不要依赖上述安全模式来执行您本来认为危险的机动或训练动作。"

#: ../../source/docs/safety-multicopter.rst:213
#: b5ad321d85764caaad21227e4112286d
msgid ""
"These modes are a supplement to, not a replacement for sound safety "
"practices."
msgstr "这些模式是对良好安全实践的补充，而非替代。"

#: ../../source/docs/safety-multicopter.rst:216
#: a00bbb5779a84e59974eda4fda7d9e21
msgid "**On your first takeoff after tuning or hardware setup:**"
msgstr "**在调参或硬件设置后首次起飞时：**"

#: ../../source/docs/safety-multicopter.rst:218
#: 9d083823596d4d78a5657be83e4b93e0
msgid ""
"In Stabilize mode advance the throttle very slowly until the copter is "
"almost hovering."
msgstr "在Stabilize模式下非常缓慢地增加油门，直到飞行器几乎悬停。"

#: ../../source/docs/safety-multicopter.rst:220
#: 3f89e236d66646618ecec53bc08e1e15
msgid ""
"If the copter is trying to flip over turn it off and correct the problem."
msgstr "如果飞行器试图翻转，立即关闭并排查问题。"

#: ../../source/docs/safety-multicopter.rst:222
#: 8f743ef7f4fd46caa4fc2c65dba8643c
msgid "A motor could be turning the wrong direction."
msgstr "可能是某个电机转向错误。"

#: ../../source/docs/safety-multicopter.rst:223
#: d15a2ebd52ab44df911ceb762a37d143
msgid "Or a wrong direction prop could be installed."
msgstr "或者安装了反向的螺旋桨。"

#: ../../source/docs/safety-multicopter.rst:224
#: 741d7b1c07c240b48d5bee0ae583305a
msgid "If it tries to rotate on its axis or fly off in some direction."
msgstr "如果飞行器试图绕轴旋转或朝某个方向飞走。"

#: ../../source/docs/safety-multicopter.rst:225
#: f2c27647d0c74149b42da7919fa72a0c
msgid "The transmitter or RC setup in Mission Planner may be incorrect."
msgstr "遥控器或 Mission Planner 中的RC设置可能有误。"

#: ../../source/docs/safety-multicopter.rst:226
#: 13802fd93f3240858faae090da5c9667
msgid "A motor or ESC may not be performing properly."
msgstr "某个电机或ESC可能工作不正常。"

#: ../../source/docs/safety-multicopter.rst:227
#: d54cd883fb1742b58f85bebfc04b6c29
msgid "The wrong props may be on the wrong motors."
msgstr "螺旋桨可能安装到了错误的电机上。"

#: ../../source/docs/safety-multicopter.rst:228
#: adab18f1cec64c26af51f2f86e33f835
msgid ""
"When all problems are fixed it should be fairly easy to get the copter to "
"hover a foot or 2 above the ground."
msgstr "所有问题解决后，应该相当容易让飞行器在距地面一两英尺的高度悬停。"

#: ../../source/docs/safety-multicopter.rst:230
#: 2e88b8bf275e407591deb106f4c32d93
msgid ""
"If a stable and stationary hover a foot or 2 above the ground cannot be "
"achieved, land and fix the problem until it can."
msgstr "如果无法在距地面一两英尺处实现稳定、静止的悬停，请降落并解决问题直至能够做到。"

#: ../../source/docs/safety-multicopter.rst:233
#: b72907ae11f14d79bd139bfc2de1beac
msgid ""
"**When flying FPV \"First Person View\" (with a video camera), Have your "
"modes set to: STABILIZE, SIMPLE, and RTL.**"
msgstr "**使用FPV\"第一人称视角\"飞行（配备摄像头）时，将模式设置为：STABILIZE、SIMPLE和RTL。**"

#: ../../source/docs/safety-multicopter.rst:236
#: 676d23ef2d9041cea3979cf550038d5c
msgid "Ensure RTL is working properly before using FPV."
msgstr "在使用FPV之前，确认RTL工作正常。"

#: ../../source/docs/safety-multicopter.rst:237
#: 8f355a0ccbb240dc9c47f424a6bae1fb
msgid "Use Stabilize mode to fly FPV."
msgstr "使用Stabilize模式进行FPV飞行。"

#: ../../source/docs/safety-multicopter.rst:238
#: fccd0c554d5b437fa08ba76a60f3d042
msgid ""
"If you lose your FPV video, you can switch to Simple or RTL to get back."
msgstr "如果FPV视频丢失，可以切换到Simple或RTL返回。"

#: ../../source/docs/safety-multicopter.rst:241
#: e44d92ce7fc44e5c835297bcd8ba4254
msgid "**Make sure your battery can't fall out.**"
msgstr "**确保电池不会掉落。**"

#: ../../source/docs/safety-multicopter.rst:243
#: 31bee9c4baab4b579eb9f1fe7788b90e
msgid "Use a Velcro Strap to hold it in place."
msgstr "使用魔术贴绑带将其固定到位。"

#: ../../source/docs/safety-multicopter.rst:244
#: 82ddea1917d842bc8baa0203732592e7
msgid "You can also use adhesive backed velcro under the battery."
msgstr "也可以在电池下方粘贴背胶魔术贴。"

#: ../../source/docs/safety-multicopter.rst:248
#: 154ec127681749908b4798bc737f9c04
msgid ""
"Get a Printable PDF Safety Sheet: `MultiCopter_Safety "
"<https://download.ardupilot.org/downloads/wiki/pdf_guides/MultiCopter_Safety.pdf>`__"
msgstr ""
"获取可打印的PDF安全手册：`MultiCopter_Safety "
"<https://download.ardupilot.org/downloads/wiki/pdf_guides/MultiCopter_Safety.pdf>`__"

#: ../../source/docs/safety-multicopter.rst:250
#: 54f5606b8a3c4ad191a5a013fcc4754a
msgid ""
"The `Copter Forum <https://discuss.ardupilot.org/c/arducopter>`__ permits "
"the developers to respond to your questions and enables you to research "
"similar issues, Please choose the sub-forum that is most appropriate to the "
"wiki page and issues you are having."
msgstr ""
"`Copter论坛 <https://discuss.ardupilot.org/c/arducopter>`__ "
"允许开发者回答您的问题，并便于您查阅类似问题，请选择与Wiki页面和您遇到的问题最相关的子论坛。"
